B: black. always black | royal blue, its classy
C: whatever matches your realm colors | something that looks good with the cloak at least
D: please not pink | do not go pink, i beg you
A: i was literally about to buy pink | ...the pink one was in my hand
~ 25
D: ok well, own it | then wear it proudly, i guess
D: i saw a group in full pink last week, they were terrifying | there was a pink group at {camp} last night. best thing i have seen
?B: pink tanks hold aggro better, its science
