D: my alchemist friend mostly makes potions for the guild raids | ask an alchemist, mine only talks about potions and poisons
~ 30
A: ok, decision: dark green with a black cloak | went with dark green. compromise
D: respectable. pink would have been braver
B: green is fine, you will blend in with the trees at least | green, good for hiding in the bushes
?D: until a stealther thinks you are a bush
